    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Configure before activation\n1. Deploy migrations 012-014 and the matching backend/UI.\n2. Select Header Auth on the HTTP node: X-Ingest-Token / existing ingest secret.\n3. Confirm the backend URL and workflow timezone. Default: 09:00 America/Argentina/Buenos_Aires.\n4. Schedule AFTER the existing Google ingestion + /process/daily workflow.\n5. Publish/activate after testing.\n\nThe first queue cycle considers the prior 14 days only. Later cycles add new versions once per workspace day. Retries and batch continuation do not duplicate cards. This workflow never approves cards, changes Sheets, or builds/sends another brief.\n\nIf the existing daily brief workflow already calls /process/publish, it can drive the same daily review cycle; use one normal scheduling path. A duplicate trigger is safely skipped after the day's review is complete.",
